    },
    {
      "tvm_method_id": 108928,
      "name": "get_name_data",
      "parameters": [],
      "return_ty_idx": 23,
      "description": "Everything an indexer needs in one call.\n\ntonapi: `any_address` for the same reason get_nft_data uses it, applied as a\nhouse rule rather than case by case. No optional address ever leaves a\nget-method of this contract as a TVM null — a reader that hits one here is a\nreader that has already succeeded on the TEP-62 method and then falls over on\nthe project-specific one, which is the worse of the two failures because\nnobody is testing for it. Emptiness is still readable: addr_none, and\nexpiresAt == 0 with isReserved == false, is an item that has never been issued."
    },
